%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/string_test.clj:253 (collapse-test)
testing: Collapse whitespace to single space
元の形: strings/collapse の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import collapse from dw::core::Strings
output application/json
---
collapse("a  b   c")
%%% output application/json
[
  "a",
  "  ",
  "b",
  "   ",
  "c"
]
